      "created_at": "2014-01-28T22:22:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>so you'll see it says smoething like [[include cdref]] (for Citizen Dawn for instance) - all you have to do is at your address bar go to&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>sotm.wikidot.com/cdref</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That will take you to the individual page. You can edit it from there.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The reason for the includes is so they can also be included on the Hero/Villain page and only require being updated in one place no matter how many places we want to use them. So if you want to look at them all, you go to the reference page. If you just want Citizen dawn info you get the same info ion her page without me having to police multiple pages :)</p>",
