      "created_at": "2014-01-29T16:58:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was looking through the list, and I remembered something.</p><p>Does anyone else remember what threadwe discussed the girl from Blighted Streets and her being the same from Vigilence and I suggested she could be the girl from the Sentinels? &nbsp;I believe Christopher confirmed that they were the same girl, that she wasn't from the sentinels, and that that girl would have a bigger part to play in he future. &nbsp;I looked for the last 20 minutes and couldn't find it, I thought it was Phantom's speculation thread but it was not.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Does anyone else remember that? &nbsp;I could be going crazy but if not that would be cool info for the references page.</p>",
